[38;2;124;124;124mWe have $X = \{(a_1, a_2, \ldots, a_n) \mid a_k \in \{0, 1, 2, \ldots, k\}, k = [0m[38;2;124;124;124m1, 2, \ldots, n\}$. So $|X| = 1 \cdot 2 \cdot 3 \cdots n = n!$.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mThe operations $\vee$ (join) and $\wedge$ (meet) are componentwise max and min. [0m[38;2;124;124;124mThis makes $X$ a lattice (product of chains $\{0\} \times \{0,1\} \times [0m
